# Live-probe artefacts: run records, findings, payloads and the id pool.
#
# These are EVIDENCE, not code — captured responses from real projects, so they carry
# workspace ids, internal hostnames and other data that has no business in a public
# repository. Nothing in src/ or tests/ reads them; only the three scripts/*-live.mts
# tools do, against a local working copy.
#
# The durable output of that work is committed: the capability index itself, and
# docs/capability-rename-map.csv.
tests/live/
__pycache__/
